# Fork-local paths: committed to the DerekAlfonso fork, never sent upstream.
#
# One path per line, relative to the repo root. A trailing "/" means the whole
# directory. Globs (*, **) are allowed. Blank lines and "#" comments are ignored.
#
# Edits to files that DO exist upstream (e.g. .gitignore) can be kept fork-only by
# wrapping them in marker lines containing ">>> fork-local" and "<<< fork-local".
# The upstream-pr skill strips those blocks.

.fork-local
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
